# Plan and Design Document Placement

When asked to create an implementation plan, design document, or any planning artifact:

1. Write the document to `docs/in-progress/<feature>/` (e.g., `docs/in-progress/complication-freshness/complication-freshness-remediation-plan.md`).
2. Do NOT use Cursor's built-in plan tool to create `.cursor/plans/` files. Those are ephemeral IDE artifacts and are gitignored.
3. When implementing from an existing plan, reference the canonical doc in `docs/in-progress/` via `@` rather than duplicating it into a Cursor plan.
4. Use `TodoWrite` for in-session progress tracking instead of plan-file checkboxes.
